        "ggouYvEl_QM_text": "<p><strong>Chris G &nbsp; &nbsp;| &nbsp; Verified Buyer</strong></p>",
        "ggwbxCW31NR_text": "<p><i>“So many zippers to put things and create more air flow. The camouflage fits amazing. I’m able to move quick and quiet as a result. This company knows what they are doing when it comes to creating quality products.”</i></p>"
      },
