        "ggYZG77wpdw_text": "<p>20% Off Your First Purchase: Begin your journey with SKRE Gear and enjoy 20% off. It’s our way of welcoming you into the fold with affordability and quality.</p>",
        "ggabjb5xBUo_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0603/0360/5923/files/gempages_490658923649434481-2e0f1b6b-783d-4322-a390-ebab02cbaf2d.jpg?v=1715634383",
